{"timestamp": 1779433933.8069487, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I found Eve dead in Storage, and Frank was right there in the room with the body when I walked in. Frank, what were you doing? Did you see what happened? \n\nFor my route: I started in lower engine, went to upper engine where I saw Charlie head towards oxygen. Then I went to medbay and saw Bob and Eve together around tick 11. After that, I headed down to storage and found Eve's body. \n\nBob, did you see where Eve went after medbay? Everyone else, we also lost Diana \u2014 someone needs to share info on where she was last seen. Let's hear what Frank and Bob have to say."}}
{"timestamp": 1779433941.390224, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I can back up Alice's story, at least for the first half of the round. My route was electrical, medbay, upper engine, oxygen, back to upper engine, and finally lower engine. I saw Alice come into upper engine from lower engine around tick 6, and she's right that I headed up to oxygen right after that. \n\nSince Alice's story matches exactly what I saw early on, I'm inclined to trust her report about Storage. Frank, you've got some serious explaining to do if you were standing right next to Eve's body. Bob, we definitely need to hear from you about what happened with Eve after you two were in Medbay. I unfortunately didn't see Diana at all this round, so I can't help there. Let's see what Frank and Bob have to say before we vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779433953.2019212, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Alice's timeline is completely accurate from my perspective. My route was Navigation, then Storage, Medbay, and finally Electrical. \n\nAt tick 10, I was in Medbay when Eve entered from Electrical. Right after that at tick 11, Alice walked in from Upper Engine. We were all there together just like she said. I left for Electrical shortly after, so I didn't see which way Eve went. \n\nSince Charlie backs up Alice's early route and I can confirm her Medbay timeline perfectly, I fully believe her report. Frank, if you were just standing over Eve's body in Storage, that makes you the prime suspect. I want to hear your defense, but unless you have an incredibly good explanation, you're getting my vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779433992.8756475, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I came into Storage from Navigation right at the end, and Eve was already there around the cargo area. I was going to do Sort Cargo. Alice came in from Medbay side almost immediately after, and the report happened before I could really process anything \u2014 I was not \u201cstanding over\u201d the body from a kill, I had just arrived.\n\nMy route was upper engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 security \u2192 navigation \u2192 storage. The main thing I can add is I saw Diana enter Security from Weapons around tick 8 while I was passing through that side, and then I went down toward Navigation. I didn\u2019t see her after that.\n\nWhat worries me is Bob\u2019s timeline: he admits he was with Eve in Medbay, then says he went to Electrical. Electrical is close enough to move around through that whole area, and he\u2019s also the last person confirming Eve alive before she ends up in Storage. Alice and Charlie vouching for each other early doesn\u2019t clear the later kill window. I get why this looks bad on me because I was in Storage when reported, but I think Bob had the better opportunity on Eve, and Diana being near Security also lines up with someone moving through that right-side route."}}
