{"timestamp": 1779434062.6860318, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "You\u2019re all locking way too fast on \u201cFrank was in the room\u201d and ignoring the timing. I literally came in from Navigation at the end and Alice came in from Medbay basically right after. If I had killed Eve, why would I just stand there next to the body and let Alice walk in on me? I would\u2019ve left back through Navigation or gone Medbay immediately.\n\nBob is the one whose path bothers me most. He was confirmed with Eve in Medbay, then says he went Electrical \u2014 that\u2019s right between Medbay/Storage/Security. Diana was last seen by me entering Security from Weapons, and Bob\u2019s claimed route puts him near that whole right side after being with Eve. Alice and Charlie only clear each other early; they don\u2019t clear Bob for the actual kill window.\n\nI\u2019m voting Bob. If you vote me just because I arrived in Storage at the wrong moment, you\u2019re throwing this."}}
